@CC %-------------------------------------------------------%
@CC % Patch to install FTPRT as a SINTRAN system server     %
@CC %-------------------------------------------------------%

@DMAC
)RESSM
)CLEAR
)CLOAD S3PATCH
176000/SSTAR
)SYSDF
)9ASSM SYMBOL-1-LIST
?

)CLOAD S3CP
30002/SGF3=^
PSSD=SSTAR-1
% ---------    UPDATE SYSTEM SERVER TABLE INDEX 10B -----
PSSD/^+20/ SGF3;100002
% ---------    ADD SERVER NAME ON COMMAND SEGM.   -------
SGF3/'FTPRT'
%--------------------------------------------------------
)KILL PSSD
)KILL SGF3; SGF3=*; SGF3:
)CLOAD S3CP
30002/SGF3
)9EXIT
